  "summary": "The paper presents three gate-based quantum algorithms: a Hedge loss estimator with query complexity O(T^2 sqrt(N) / epsilon), an active sampling version with O(T^2 sqrt(N)) queries, and a Quantum Sparsitron with runtime eO(lambda^6 sqrt(N) / epsilon^7). It also gives a classical approximate Sparsitron runtime eO(N lambda^2 / epsilon^2 + lambda^6 / epsilon^6), but no hardware experiments or empirical benchmarks are reported.",
